WEBVTT

00:12:58.196 --> 00:13:02.116
So what next for this
significant specimen?

00:13:02.796 --> 00:13:04.596
Well, despite ongoing plans

00:13:04.636 --> 00:13:09.316
to try to replace the Rutland Water
Nature Reserve with “Joerassic Park” --

00:13:09.316 --> 00:13:10.916
(Laughter)

00:13:10.916 --> 00:13:12.076
I'm sorry, I'm sorry.

00:13:12.116 --> 00:13:13.276
I apologize.

00:13:15.316 --> 00:13:16.596
Compose myself.

00:13:17.716 --> 00:13:19.476
No, the next major step

00:13:19.476 --> 00:13:24.996
is for Nigel to clean and conserve
the entire skeleton.

00:13:25.356 --> 00:13:27.676
And this is going to take
at least two years

00:13:27.716 --> 00:13:29.276
to get to that point.

00:13:29.836 --> 00:13:31.316
At that stage, then,